/target
**/*.rs~
**/*~
.claude/worktrees/
# `cargo run -p autocitefetch-cli` drops its cache in the working directory.
# A consuming project only needs the second line: every throwaway file the cache
# writes hides under `._<base>`, so `.citations.jsonl` stays committable without
# any un-ignoring. Here the committed file is a scratch artifact too, so both go.
/.citations*
/._.citations*
